        "en": "Home position: your fingers rest on the middle row of the keyboard, and the index fingers lie on the keys with bumps. **F** — left index finger, **J** — right index finger (both keys have bumps, so you can find them by touch). **D** — left middle finger. After every letter return your fingers to their place and do not look at the keyboard."
      },
